{"title": "MEA states passports are for travel only", "summary": "The Ministry of External Affairs clarified that Indian passports serve as travel documents rather than proofs of citizenship. This statement was made alongside reports on a significant expansion in passport services and infrastructure.", "summary_points": ["An MEA official stated during the 14th Passport Seva Divas that passports are not proof of citizenship.", "The government reported expanding its network to over 500 centers across India.", "More than 1.5 crore passport services were delivered in 2025 alone.", "Officials noted these measures have made overseas travel easier for citizens."], "title_hi": "MEA ने कहा कि पासपोर्ट केवल यात्रा का दस्तावेज़ है", "summary_hi": "विदेशी मामलों की मंत्रालय (MEA) ने स्पष्ट किया कि भारतीय पासपोर्ट नागरिकता का प्रमाण नहीं हैं। इस विधान को मेवाली पर आयोजित 14वें पासपोर्ट सेवा दिवस के दौरान दिया गया था, जहाँ सरकार ने भी पासपोर्ट सेवाओं और बुनियादी ढांचे में महत्वपूर्ण विस्तार की जानकारी दी थी।", "summary_points_hi": ["MEA अधिकारी ने कहा कि भारतीय पासपोर्ट नागरिकता का प्रमाण नहीं हैं।"], "topic": "Politics", "image_url": "https://images.indianexpress.com/2026/06/image-pd-40.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "The Tribune", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "For avinash sir: Passport network expands six-fold in last decade; 1.5 cr services delivered in 2025: MEA official"}, {"source": "The Indian Express", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://indianexpress.com/article/india/passport-travel-document-not-proof-of-citizenship-mea-10755656", "headline": "Passport a travel document, not a proof of citizenship: MEA"}, {"source": "Mint", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.livemint.com/news/india/passport-not-a-citizenship-document-says-mea-jaishankar-travel-document-11782317525871.html", "headline": "Passport a travel document, not a proof of citizenship, says External Affairs Ministry"}, {"sour